    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 15:09:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久没更新，但完成了我们人生中的一个大事件</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="113">01:53</a> 身为🌈为什么要结婚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="547">09:07</a> 为什么要去纽约结婚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="702">11:42</a> 纽约（州）结婚的大致流程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="856">14:16</a> 一路遇到的大小挫折</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">21:21</a> 在结婚现场时的一些观察</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1463">24:23</a> 结婚当下的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2153">35:53</a> 结婚后有什么改变吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>在 NYC City Clerk's Office 门口等着结婚登记的人们：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmCbAhhIb7kopeDdG_rPf5SZV_oZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>领 license 时拿的号码牌：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fixf3ar51JEX913UC1oWIcq095Pw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>交换戒指的时刻：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrdDospvFWgJK3EQKaqcV1-lZx30.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>结婚 Ceremony 所在的 Queens City Clerk's Office 门口盛开的玉兰花：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjHau8R6nU65qoN428mlKemVqPUz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP: </span><em><span>I Say a Little Prayer</span></em><span> by Diana King</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED:《飞女正传》by 杨千嬅</span></p>]]></description>
