  <item>
    <title>14 渴望爱的人，一样卑微也一样高贵</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d9b807ee04007d886b8d72</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d9b807ee04007d886b8d72</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Sep 2024 13:54:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在亲密关系中一味无私无求地奉献，怎么可能会被珍惜？</span></p><span></span><p><span>一段和好友的闲聊杂谈，谈谈我们都一样，又都不一样的，渴望被爱的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：阿泽</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">01:28</a> 「我是同X恋！」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="592">09:52</a> 对爱慢半拍，爱就say goodbye</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="893">14:53</a> date1 - 不被爱久了，只能怀疑自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1368">22:48</a> date2 - 也许我只是池子里的一条鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1879">31:19</a> date3 - 对的人错的时间只有遗憾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2243">37:23</a> 我们都该在关系里绽放自我勇敢要求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 让dating对象认识好友？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3762">01:02:42</a> 梦回初中少年事</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：韦礼安《世界上最重要的人》</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：陶喆《太美丽》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltPkKoZjaijVqAYDbZrFOpxKsAKK.m4a" length="74567268" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:16:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsgSgoqzAsXGvRXmc-lvJSRK_x3L.png"/>
