  <item>
    <title>13 姬基复姬基，你的漂亮朋友也姓基</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b47d6398727a67998a2186</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b47d6398727a67998a2186</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 08 Aug 2024 08:10:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有人说 gay 与 lesbian 在生活中缺少交集，很难成为朋友——这到底是迷思还是写实？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：Rox &amp; K</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 「拉拉」是个有点冒犯的词么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="172">02:52</a> 女同和男同毫无交集么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="437">07:17</a> 批判一下女同=铁T的刻板印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="648">10:48</a> 确认自己身份的过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">26:27</a> T 与 P 的角色划分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1853">30:53</a> Les 们如何在人群中识别出彼此？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2401">40:01</a> 有关三人行，亲密关系，承诺，……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3089">51:29</a> 激进的必要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3918">01:05:18</a> Les 情侣的关系模式</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP, ED</span><em><span>: Welcome To My Island</span></em><span> by Caroline Polachek</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmwcJD-GaQrCqJ9IdR5-uAxSxdD1.m4a" length="74606819" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:16:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhJHFuGQcu5bg5Tqh-AQ4OKhyK0w.png"/>
