  <item>
    <title>12 参加完别人的婚礼，来畅想下我们给子的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66abafb633ddcbb53cb2ea61</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66abafb633ddcbb53cb2ea61</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 02 Aug 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>小c和老七不久前参加了一场梦幻巴厘岛婚礼：阳光、沙滩、海浪、蓝天、鲜花……世间一切美丽的事物都在衬托一对新人的盟誓</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是，给子们梦想中的婚礼，原来要的很简单…？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：Ryan</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft-5w1zgVJOkWb90UuMEyrfbl4yw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="118">01:58</a> 婚礼上让我们感动/印象深刻的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a> 被邀请做伴郎的心情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a> 为什么老七从没被邀请过做伴郎？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1269">21:09</a> 这样一场婚礼后对婚姻的看法有改变么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2315">38:35</a> 如何看待「仪式感」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2449">40:49</a> 我们理想中的婚礼是啥样的</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：《永恒的主题》 by 丁世光</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：</span><em><span>Hymne A L'Amour</span></em><span> by Céline Dion</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqtOh-LijdYF3NPk9TBFbdPgQzim.m4a" length="46784770" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:12</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsMRHpyndO6GCqH0ifJBMPNo7O3D.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
