  <item>
    <title>11 大师掐指一算，你是不是 txl 早已被生辰八字决定</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668b818d0bc5d7cc70974b5d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668b818d0bc5d7cc70974b5d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jul 2024 06:05:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>求签、术数、占星、塔罗……年轻人仿佛越来越热衷于从神秘力量的运转中获得启示。今天我们请来了多年好友，有着十多年八字命理学（俗称算命）实操经验的李天师，来闲谈下从业者眼中的「玄学热」。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从八字真的可以看出一个人的性取向么？宇宙冥冥之中，我们的命运，又到底掌握在谁的手里？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：李天师</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a> 李天师接触命理学的缘起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">04:26</a> 什么是命理学？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="599">09:59</a> 八字命理学的语言系统</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="809">13:29</a> 李天师的推算经历：根据人的生平倒推出生时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1075">17:55</a> 八个字的权重是不一样的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1161">19:21</a> 出生在海外甚至南半球是业内难题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1274">21:14</a> 看命格可以看出性取向么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1793">29:53</a> 人只会记得不好的地方，所以别去算命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2365">39:25</a> 搞占星和塔罗的是同行么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2858">47:38</a> 风水、科学、当代新理论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3059">50:59</a> 终极拷问：李天师自己信命么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP &amp; ED：《運命》by sumika</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>李天师临湖远眺：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoNjTq9k-YOf-Vj9KGV7R417CJr0.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/livyoWgSUw-Ji32rV7zQtgUjWuxW.m4a" length="61815094" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:03:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnL4FEl5zEYdrdlaP2ehLtHqbTgY.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>10 拜托，都三十岁了还在叫自己男孩么</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6674144cb6a8412729274703</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6674144cb6a8412729274703</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 20 Jun 2024 11:36:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>刚刚年过三旬的小c，和老七一起瞎聊聊我们的「三十而没立」</span></p><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 同志身份与社会时钟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">07:12</a> 「松弛感」的两岸差异，想和黄宣一样自在</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="831">13:51</a> 时间不等人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1146">19:06</a> 30+岁以后的社交圈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1361">22:41</a> 「三十而立」的束缚与孔子的被误读</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">30:10</a> 年纪增长就意味着试错成本变高？</span></p><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><p><span>OP &amp; ED：《干杯》by 五月天</span></p>]]></description>
