  <item>
    <title>09 双胞胎兄弟都喜欢男生是怎样的体验？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6643196382b428eafd7aec45</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6643196382b428eafd7aec45</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 May 2024 07:57:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Gay twins 是一个让旁人难免浮想联翩，又充满好奇的神秘身份。世界上有另一个镜像的自己，也和自己一样喜欢同性，会有怎样特别的人生经历？</span></p><p><span>本期嘉宾 Timi &amp; 欢欢 （隐藏嘉宾 Dimi）</span></p><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="139">02:19</a> 青春期双方如何试探对方？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">05:35</a> 在什么契机下两人开始互相坦诚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="552">09:12</a> 从小被早出生 5 分钟的哥哥照顾得无微不至</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="722">12:02</a> Ti 爸 Ti 妈高明的管理手段</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a> 弟弟会吃「嫂子」的醋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1005">16:45</a> 如何一同面对父母与是否出柜的命题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1259">20:59</a> 揭秘！身为双胞胎的方便与不便之处</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1579">26:19</a> 也会心疼哥哥的付出型人格</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2061">34:21</a> 作为被照顾的一方，性格是先天还是后天形成的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2201">36:41</a> 双胞胎之间有没有心灵感应</span></p><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><p><span>OP &amp; ED：《见习爱神》by Twins</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lj6n7KFewpRMhZA7npmGYiegr6ik.m4a" length="41222011" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FidYwQcUIAmoYQSV97fw3IJmuDdp.png"/>
