  <item>
    <title>07 舅舅的男朋友叫舅咪，儿子的老公叫…</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6610cc614f66d1c1da436d3d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6610cc614f66d1c1da436d3d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 06 Apr 2024 04:15:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>浅聊一下「称谓/称呼」何以对于我们来说是一个问题，这个问题又为什么重要（或不重要）</span></p><span></span><p><span>网传同性婚姻家庭家属互称表：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuLHlQLEJFaHu1K1MALC25kTLJm_.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="114">01:54</a> 你会怎么称呼你的伴侣？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">06:05</a> 小孩如何区分两个爸爸（或妈妈）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="461">07:41</a> 希望你的父母如何称呼你的伴侣？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 现在汉语中「她」字的被发明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">17:52</a> 当代还应该称呼女教授女学者为「先生」么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1298">21:38</a> 称谓/称呼重要么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：《露丝玛丽》</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：Kanon D-dur (Strings Orchestra)</span></p>]]></description>
