  <item>
    <title>06 朋友还是date？在模糊中寻找共鸣和欢愉</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65fea10f2d9eae5d0a8c7dce</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65fea10f2d9eae5d0a8c7dce</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 23 Mar 2024 09:29:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>像我们一样的🌈男孩还可以和男生思无邪地交朋友吗？在微妙的试探和摸索中，我们又如何界定一段关系属于友谊还是恋爱的范畴呢？……</span></p><p><span>（这也是本节目第一次触及亲密关系的话题，怕怕</span></p><p><span>本期嘉宾 Muko</span></p><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="149">02:29</a> 嘉宾 Muko 最近一段不知道如何定性的邂逅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a> 发现约会对象有男友怎么办？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="722">12:02</a> 通讯录如何结交普通朋友？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 震惊！老七从来没有过任何 gay friend！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1464">24:24</a> sex + 朋友 ≠ 男朋友</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1905">31:45</a> 对方和现任立刻分手，自己就会开心么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2362">39:22</a> 拒绝二元论，拒绝非黑即白</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2916">48:36</a> 能斩钉截铁说出来的话都是屁话</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3226">53:46</a> 在模糊暧昧的地方才有最大的欢愉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3320">55:20</a> 普通朋友 vs 「恋爱朋友」</span></p><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><p><span>OP, ED: </span><em><span>You Will Be Found</span></em><span> from </span><em><span>Dear Evan Hansen</span></em></p>]]></description>
