  <item>
    <title>04 凭什么直男就不会精神内耗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e72c79a4d1fbe7c081fd13</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e72c79a4d1fbe7c081fd13</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 05 Mar 2024 14:30:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这几年，「精神内耗」一词频繁出现在我们生活中，而且通常是作为一种负面表述，大家也因此逐渐了解到自己常常感觉到心力憔悴的原由。但是，「内耗」这事是认知到就能改的吗？又或者说，到底需不需要改？让我们聊聊吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="211">03:31</a> 约吃饭找个餐厅担心连环丢讯息打扰到朋友？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="407">06:47</a> 「内耗」是个贬义词吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a> 台湾同胞好像天生更乐天？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a> 暴论：直男比 gay 和女性更不内耗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1338">22:18</a> 内耗的人负责站岗去吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1506">25:06</a> 你猜猜如何能做到不内耗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1747">29:07</a> 内不内耗靠合作搭配！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：《一想到你呀》by A-Lin</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：《大大的拥抱》by A-Lin</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lociG68nwsMRjRboIXg3hRENAKdR.m4a" length="34642154" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZxdWQzWDNyVml2LV9vR3RNREl0dHFyOVcwcHAucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
