  <item>
    <title>03 当遭遇催婚时，我们的生存之道</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c24f4e3af97665afadacc0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c24f4e3af97665afadacc0</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Feb 2024 15:25:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎光临</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期我们针对回家过年会遭遇的各种压力做了些讨论。从谈论催婚，到孩子，到伴侣，到这背后的原因，我们发现这些来自家人的唠叨，是对我们未来生活的挂念。</span></p><span></span><p><span>结婚生子是一条他/她们走过的路，熟悉的路，“正规”的路，也是他/她们能指给我们最保险的路。当我们理解到这一点，还能抱怨什么呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">00:57</a> 从不可以谈恋爱，到什么时候结婚的跨度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="732">12:12</a> 二叔，你是正常人嘛？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a> 「我们只是在变老，却没有长大」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1442">24:02</a> 孩子对你来说意味着什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1884">31:24</a> 家是一团火，是想到心里就暖暖的</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP: </span><em><span>Cry Cry Cry</span></em><span> by Coldplay</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED: </span><em><span>September Song</span></em><span> by Agnes Obel</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpfzn_W5wDPio6rsOOVIM3P92KGW.m4a" length="26757809" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L2xqOWowcnBqckFkclctWjRDLUMzVmpBTUxLWEwucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
