  <item>
    <title>02 是枝裕和《怪物》| 记得每朵花名的男孩子并不恶心</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65b3efa96a43241529a8ec7d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65b3efa96a43241529a8ec7d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Jan 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期我们一起聊了聊一部我们最近刚刚看过，也非常有感触的电影——是枝裕和导演的《怪物》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌈从性少数视角如何看待这一部影片？像我们一样的男孩，从这段少年心事的故事中找到了怎样的共鸣？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frz1G19bDoJUen1MN_CpHQ-gkfUL.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="149">02:29</a> 多视角三段式与《罗生门》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">06:15</a> 到底谁是「怪物」？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="678">11:18</a> 复杂多面的人物：田中裕子饰演的学校校长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1013">16:53</a> 妈妈说，知道每朵花名字的男孩子不会受女生欢迎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1133">18:53</a> 勇敢表达出自己爱意的瞬间最让人感动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a> 校园霸凌是每个玫瑰少年都必经的么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1853">30:53</a> 东亚vs欧美：不同的社会环境与电影表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2033">33:53</a> 直男导演爱拍gay片？对比李安、陈凯歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2211">36:51</a> 小演员的拍后感：「喜欢男生就和喜欢苹果一样寻常」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2238">37:18</a> 坂本龙一的配乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：《hibari》坂本龙一</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：《Aqua》坂本龙一</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>单集标题 credit to 豆瓣网友@湖畔的蓝莓吐司</span></p>]]></description>
